#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/lighten.rst:230
msgid "Pin Light"
msgstr "Pin Light"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/lighten.rst:232
msgid ""
"Checks which is darker the lower layer's pixel or the upper layer's double "
"so bright. Then checks which is brighter of that result or the inversion of "
"the doubled lower layer."
msgstr ""
"Controleert welke donkerder is het pixel van de lagere laag of van de dubbel "
"zo heldere bovenste laag. Controleert daarna welke helderder is van dat "
"resultaat of de inversie van de verdubbelde lagere laag."

